flowchart LR
    Start([POST /api/reports]) --> Auth{Authenticated active PART?}
    Auth -->|No| Reject[Return safe 401 or 403]
    Auth -->|Yes| Verified{Verified account?}
    Verified -->|No| Reject
    Verified -->|Yes| Shape{Valid target, category, and text?}
    Shape -->|No| Validation[Return field validation]
    Shape -->|Yes| Target{Target eligible and visible?}
    Target -->|No| Hidden[Return safe target unavailable]
    Target -->|Yes| Quota{Fewer than 5 reports in 60 minutes?}
    Quota -->|No| Limited[Return 429 and retry guidance]
    Quota -->|Yes| Case{Open case for target?}
    Case -->|Yes| Increment[Increment report count]
    Case -->|No| Create[Create Open moderation case]
    Increment --> Persist[Insert private moderation report]
    Create --> Persist
    Persist --> Receipt[Return minimal Received receipt]
    Receipt --> Pipeline[Existing ADMIN moderation pipeline]

    ReadAttempt([GET participant reports]) --> ReadDenied[Always return 403]
    Later[US-033 later adds chat-message reporting outside US-025] -.-> Pipeline

